Per the zcode-visual-parity plan (docs/plans/completed/), ZCode's look —
tokens, typography scale, spacing, radii, shadows — is adopted as
smind's visual design system, no ZCode logos, names, or other branding
included. This is a notice of derivation under Apache-2.0 §4(d), not a
relicensing of smind; smind as a whole remains AGPL-3.0 (see
docs/decisions/0003-agpl-license-no-repo-split.md).

Derived material, by file:

- `web/packages/ui/src/index.css` — the `@theme`/`:root`/`.dark`
  semantic color token values (background/surface/card/popover/menu/
  input families, foreground hierarchy, border families, success/
  warning/destructive, diff/git-status colors, find-highlight, hover/
  selected/primary/secondary, toast/tooltip/tag, the terminal 16-color
  set) and the `--ui-font-size`/`--text-ui-*` type-scale formulas, ported
  from ZCode's `packages/ui/src/styles.css` (`.theme-zai-light`/
  `.theme-zai-dark`/`@theme` blocks). Values only — no ZCode source code
  structure, comments, or file layout was copied.

This section is updated as later phases of the zcode-visual-parity plan
port additional ZCode-derived component structure or CSS.
